  "logline": "Modica, Sicily. 1972. A Brooklyn-born Vietnam veteran defends his family's honor against a ruthless local padrone -- not through violence, but by publicly destroying the currency of corruption itself.",
  "detail": "Based on the narrative structure of The Quiet Man (1952), transplanted to Baroque Sicily. Shot on location in Modica. Italian language with English subtitles. Key characters: Santo Calvino, Lucia, Angela, Don Lino Gradi. A story about shame, honor, and what it means to come home.",
